    <h2>6. Data Security and Cryptography</h2>
    <p>
        We employ industry-standard on-device security safeguards:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Operating System Sandboxing:</strong> All SQLite database records are stored in Android's application-private storage space, preventing access by other apps installed on the device.</li>
        <li><strong>Salted SHA-256 PIN Security:</strong> App lock authentication utilizes cryptographic SHA-256 with unique salts. Cleartext PINs are never persisted.</li>
        <li><strong>CSV Formula Injection Mitigation:</strong> Exported spreadsheets are sanitized against spreadsheet formula injection (CWE-1236) to prevent malicious formula execution when opened in Excel or Google Sheets.</li>
        <li><strong>Cache Auto-Pruning:</strong> Temporary shared reports and PDF bills in application cache are automatically deleted after 24 hours to prevent lingering copies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Data Retention and Deletion (User Control)</h2>
